        <headline>High Wind Warning issued September 25 at 9:19AM PDT until September 25 at 11:00AM PDT by NWS Portland OR</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Southwest winds 30 to 40 mph with gusts up to 70 mph.

* WHERE...Willapa Hills.

* WHEN...Until 11 AM PDT this morning.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and widely scattered power outages are
expected.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Full leaf cover on trees may result in trees
or limbs suffering wind damage at lower wind speeds than usual.
</description>
        <instruction>People are urged to secure loose objects that could be blown around
or damaged by the wind.

Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
